  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h2>LIN Transceiver Driver (LinTrcv)</h2><p class=\"lead\">Controls physical bus transceiver states and wakeup on LIN lines.</p>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3>Funktionen — Übersicht</h3>\n<ul class=\"mlist\">\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinTrcv_00001\">LinTrcv_Init</a> (const LinTrcv_ConfigType* ConfigPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Initializes the Lin Transceiver Driver module.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinTrcv_00002\">LinTrcv_SetOpMode</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> Lin Network, LinTrcv_TrcvModeType OpMode);</code> <span class=\"dim\">The internal state of the LIN transceiver driver is switched to mode given in the parameter Op Mode.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinTrcv_00005\">LinTrcv_GetOpMode</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> Lin Network, LinTrcv_TrcvModeType* OpMode);</code> <span class=\"dim\">API detects the actual software state of LIN transceiver driv er.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinTrcv_00007\">LinTrcv_GetBusWuReason</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> Lin Network, LinTrcv_TrcvWakeupReasonType* Reason);</code> <span class=\"dim\">This API provides the reason for the wakeup that the LIN transceiver has detected in the parameter \"Reason\".</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinTrcv_00008\">LinTrcv_GetVersionInfo</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00015\">Std_VersionInfoType</a>* versioninfo);</code> <span class=\"dim\">This service provides the version information of this module through the parameter \"versioninfo\".</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinTrcv_00012\">LinTrcv_CheckWakeup</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> Lin Network);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service LinTrcv_CheckWakeup.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinTrcv_00009\">LinTrcv_SetWakeupMode</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> LINNetwork, LinTrcv_TrcvWakeupModeType Trcv WakupMode);</code> <span class=\"dim\">This API enables, disables and clears the notification for wakeup events on the addressed network.</span></li>\n</ul>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3>Typen — Übersicht</h3>\n<ul class=\"mlist\">\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">struct <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinTrcv_00172\">LinTrcv_ConfigType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Configuration data structure of the Lin Trcv module.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">enum <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinTrcv_00168\">LinTrcv_TrcvModeType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Operating modes of the LIN Transceiver Driver</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">enum <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinTrcv_00169\">LinTrcv_TrcvWakeupModeType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Wake up operating modes of the LIN Transceiver Driver.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">enum <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinTrcv_00170\">LinTrcv_TrcvWakeupReasonType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This type denotes the wake up reason detected by the LIN transceiver in detail.</span></li>\n</ul>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
